I get up from my desk.
I go near Priya's desk.
Priya is the UI designer of our team.
I smile and say hello to her.
"Hello Maya, come sit," Priya says.
"Priya, have you made the designs for the new project?" I ask.
"Yes, I have prepared some initial screens," she answers.
She shows me her computer monitor.
She has designed a very beautiful interface.
"This is very good," I say, looking at the design.
"The colors and buttons are in exactly the right place."
"Thank you Maya," she says happily.
"I have worked in this field for five years."
"As a UI designer, my job is to make the software easy."
"You have really done very good work," I say.
Now we both talk about those screens together.
I have to write my code according to the design.
I feel very good working with her.
